       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TCHKPNT.
      *================================================================*
      * UNIT TESTS FOR CHKPOINT - A RUN THAT STOPS HALF WAY IS RESUMED *
      * FROM ITS LAST COMMIT; A COMPLETED RUN IS NOT                   *
      *================================================================*
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY CKPPARM.
           COPY UTWS.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'CHKPOINT' TO UT-SUITE

           MOVE 'FIRST BEGIN IS A FRESH RUN' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 1000-BEGIN
           MOVE 'N' TO UT-EXPECTED-STR
           MOVE CKP-RESTARTED TO UT-ACTUAL-STR
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-STR

      *    STEP 1 DONE, THEN TWO COMMITS INSIDE STEP 2
           SET CKP-END-STEP TO TRUE
           MOVE 1 TO CKP-STEP
           MOVE 'TOTALS-A' TO CKP-COUNTERS
           CALL 'CHKPOINT' USING CKP-PARMS
           SET CKP-SAVE TO TRUE
           MOVE 'KEY-0010' TO CKP-LAST-KEY
           MOVE 10 TO CKP-RECORDS
           CALL 'CHKPOINT' USING CKP-PARMS
           MOVE 'KEY-0020' TO CKP-LAST-KEY
           MOVE 20 TO CKP-RECORDS
           MOVE 'TOTALS-B' TO CKP-COUNTERS
           CALL 'CHKPOINT' USING CKP-PARMS

      *    "CRASH" - BEGIN AGAIN FOR THE SAME DATE
           MOVE 'SECOND BEGIN IS A RESTART' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 1000-BEGIN
           MOVE 'Y' TO UT-EXPECTED-STR
           MOVE CKP-RESTARTED TO UT-ACTUAL-STR
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-STR

           MOVE 'RESTART RETURNS THE LAST FINISHED STEP' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE CKP-STEP TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'RESTART RETURNS THE LAST COMMITTED KEY' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 'KEY-0020' TO UT-EXPECTED-STR
           MOVE CKP-LAST-KEY TO UT-ACTUAL-STR
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-STR

           MOVE 'RESTART RETURNS THE SAVED COUNTERS' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 'TOTALS-B' TO UT-EXPECTED-STR
           MOVE CKP-COUNTERS TO UT-ACTUAL-STR
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-STR

           MOVE 'RESTART COUNT IS 1' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE CKP-RESTARTS TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           SET CKP-COMPLETE TO TRUE
           CALL 'CHKPOINT' USING CKP-PARMS
           MOVE 'AFTER COMPLETE, BEGIN STARTS FRESH' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 1000-BEGIN
           MOVE 'N' TO UT-EXPECTED-STR
           MOVE CKP-RESTARTED TO UT-ACTUAL-STR
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-STR

           MOVE 'FRESH RUN HAS NO KEY' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE SPACES TO UT-EXPECTED-STR
           MOVE CKP-LAST-KEY TO UT-ACTUAL-STR
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-STR

           MOVE 'ANOTHER RUN DATE IS INDEPENDENT' TO UT-NAME
           INITIALIZE CKP-PARMS
           SET CKP-BEGIN TO TRUE
           MOVE 'UNITTEST' TO CKP-PROGRAM
           MOVE 20991231 TO CKP-RUN-DATE
           CALL 'CHKPOINT' USING CKP-PARMS
           MOVE 'N' TO UT-EXPECTED-STR
           MOVE CKP-RESTARTED TO UT-ACTUAL-STR
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-STR

           PERFORM UT-FINISH
           STOP RUN.

       1000-BEGIN.
           INITIALIZE CKP-PARMS
           SET CKP-BEGIN TO TRUE
           MOVE 'UNITTEST' TO CKP-PROGRAM
           MOVE 20261014 TO CKP-RUN-DATE
           CALL 'CHKPOINT' USING CKP-PARMS.

           COPY UTPROC.
